<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>2.4.5: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00431</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.4.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>916fa776-de43-4ec6-b675-c61bb8c12ced</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section class="practice">
      <para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
      <para>For questions 1 – 8, solve the systems of equations using the elimination method.</para>

        <exercise id="de4b55db-3c3d-4fbf-802a-2fdb361502fa" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem>
            <para>
              \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}5x\;+\;2y\;=\;2\\-6x\;-\;2y\;=\;0\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</para>
            <para>Multiple Choice:</para>
            <para>\((–3,9)\)</para>
            <para>\((0,1)\)</para>
            <para>\((2,–4)\)</para>
            <para>\((–2,6)\)</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! (–2,6)</para>
            <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.4.2.</para>
            <para>The correct answer is (–2,6).</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>

        <exercise id="_1ef45c95-a2ca-4d74-9d47-59d60e215782" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem>
            <para>
              \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}2x\;-\;5y\;=\;7\\-15x\;+\;5y\;=\;-85\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</para>
            <para>Multiple Choice:</para>
            <para>\((7,4)\)</para>
            <para>\((5,−2)\)</para>
            <para>\((6,1)\)</para>
            <para>\((−4,−3)\)</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! (6,1)</para>
            <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.4.2.</para>
            <para>The correct answer is (6,1).</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>

        <exercise id="_4abaa7ae-ee8d-4cee-80da-26363cb2a64e" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem>
            <para>
              \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}6x\;-\;10y\;=\;-18\\25x\;+\;10y\;=\;80\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</para>
            <para>Multiple Choice:</para>
            <para>\((2,3)\)</para>
            <para>\((7,6)\)</para>
            <para>\((0,8)\)</para>
            <para>\((4,−2)\)</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! (2,3)</para>
            <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.4.2.</para>
            <para>The correct answer is (2,3).</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>

        <exercise id="_75fa3632-dadc-489a-9eff-d203695279a5" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem>
            <para>
              \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}-6x\;-\;16y\;=\;6\\6x\;+\;15y\;=\;-9\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</para>
            <para>Multiple Choice:</para>
            <para>\((–14,5)\)</para>
            <para>\((–9,3)\)</para>
            <para>\((1,–1)\)</para>
            <para>\((7,–2)\)</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! (–9,3)</para>
            <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.4.2.</para>
            <para>The correct answer is (–9,3).</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>

        <exercise id="_1606a163-8ce5-4423-b192-a7a80db1b8df" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem>
            <para>
              \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}-15x\;-\;40y\;=\;-335\\15x\;+\;9y\;=\;180\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</para>
            <para>Multiple Choice:</para>
            <para>\((12,0)\)</para>
            <para>\((9,5)\)</para>
            <para>\((17,2)\)</para>
            <para>\((6,10)\)</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! (9,5)</para>
            <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.4.2.</para>
            <para>The correct answer is (9,5).</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>

        <exercise id="_7f62f6bc-0927-4701-ad87-7bd26075d331" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem>
            <para>
              \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}x\;-\;3y\;=\;-9\\x\;+\;\frac52y\;=\;2\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</para>
            <para>Multiple Choice:</para>
            <para>\((–3,2)\)</para>
            <para>\((0,3)\)</para>
            <para>\((2,0)\)</para>
            <para>\((–9,0)\)</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! (–3,2)</para>
            <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.4.2.</para>
            <para>The correct answer is (–3,2).</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>

        <exercise id="_76adac7b-2ac7-4495-939d-f3d72bf39cbc" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem>
            <para>
              \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}x\;+\;\frac13y\;=\;3\\2x\;+\;\frac13y\;=\;5\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</para>
            <para>Multiple Choice:</para>
            <para>\((3,0)\)</para>
            <para>\((0,9)\)</para>
            <para>\((0,15)\)</para>
            <para>\((2,3)\)</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! (2,3)</para>
            <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.4.2.</para>
            <para>The correct answer is (2,3).</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>

        <exercise id="fe2806c3-3036-44ac-a849-e20f06597ff8" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem>
            <para>
              \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}3x\;-\;8y\;=\;-35\\-5x\;+\;8y\;=\;45\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</para>
            <para>Multiple Choice:</para>
            <para>\((–9,0)\)</para>
            <para>\((7,7)\)</para>
            <para>\((–5,2.5)\)</para>
            <para>\((–1,4)\)</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! (–5,2.5)</para>
            <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.4.2.</para>
            <para>The correct answer is (–5,2.5).</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>

      <para>For questions 9 – 10, add the equations in the following systems of equations. What is
        the resulting new equation?</para>

        <exercise id="_15b8e870-9833-4088-8cc6-2900e1100eaf" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem>
            <para>
              \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}4x\;-\;6y\;=\;14\\-4x\;+\;y\;=\;-19\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! \(–5y = –5\)</para>
            <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.4.3.</para>
            <para>The correct answer is \(–5y = –5\).</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>

        <exercise id="_74aafc2f-8f98-44df-871e-38f772a35e51" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem>
            <para>
              \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}3x\;-\;5y\;=\;18\\7x\;+\;5y\;=\;-8\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! \(10x = 10\)</para>
            <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.4.3.</para>
            <para>The correct answer is \(10 x = 10\).</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
    </section>
  </content>
